The '''Bubble Wink''' was a [[Outer Rim Territories]] [[hyperspace route]] that connected the worlds of [[Rampa II]] in the [[Corporate Sector]] and [[Panna]] in the [[Cronese Mandate]]. The former [[pirate]] [[Queen]] [[Maz Kanata]] listed it as one of the "real" trade routes to be used by [[smuggler]]s, as opposed to the official ones, in the [[book]] that would become known as the ''[[Smuggler's Guide]]''.<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

==Behind the scenes==
The Bubble Wink was first mentioned in ''[[Star Wars: Smuggler's Guide]]'', a reference book written by [[Daniel Wallace]] and released in [[2018]].<ref name="Smuggler's Guide" />

